{
  "$comment": "Every DOM dependency of the Meet adapter (docs/adr/0004). NOT CALIBRATED: the strategies are educated guesses from Meet's known conventions and have not been checked against a real Google Meet call, so all are verified=false. Follow docs/meet-adapter/calibration.md to verify or fix them. Strategies are tried in order; regexes are case-insensitive and every locale is tried.",
  "version": 1,
